# ── The rest of the internal app list, same shape, added on request
# (2026-11-06) so every app in the product list has a subdomain ready to
# switch on, even for ones with no near-term launch plan — appEntry.ts's
# SINGLE_APP_HOSTS already maps all of these. HuduFreight and SafeTracker
# are the same app (route /tracking) under two names, so they share one
# block each pointed at the same origin. Workspace (tenant Admin console)
# and SuperAdmin (platform console) are kept on deliberately distinct
# hostnames — see appEntry.ts's comment on why.

